#
# Snyk findings that Halyx can't fix itself, each with the reason. They expire so they are looked at again.
#
# Spring Boot 3.5 line: the auto-configuration, the starter and the Spring Data module are built and tested against
# the versions Boot 3.5 manages, so they work in Boot 3.5 applications, and an application's own Boot BOM decides the
# versions it runs. Spring Framework 6.2.19 and Spring for Apache Kafka 3.3.16 are the last open-source releases of
# their lines, and these fixes exist only in Spring Framework 7 and Spring for Apache Kafka 4 (Spring Boot 4).
version: v1.25.0
ignore:
  SNYK-JAVA-ORGSPRINGFRAMEWORK-19267072:
    - '*':
        reason: Spring Framework 6.2 (Boot 3.5 line); fixed only in 7.0.9. The application's Boot BOM decides.
        expires: 2027-04-22T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z
