  # Reactor Netty's HTTP/1.1 pipelining issue is in its HTTP server. Halyx uses only its HTTP client, through the
  # Azure SDK. The fix (1.3.7) needs Netty 4.2, while the AWS and Azure SDKs and Lettuce 6 stay on Netty 4.1.
  SNYK-JAVA-IOPROJECTREACTORNETTY-19267394:
    - '*':
        reason: Server-side (HTTP/1.1 pipelining); Halyx uses only the client. The fix needs Netty 4.2.
        expires: 2027-04-22T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z
